{"id":27627,"slug":"black-moon","title":"Black Moon","year":1975,"country":"France","duration":100,"spine":571,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/27627-black-moon","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/50696e5fa4977c31d4578e1e2e200549/GlVdQdtGEkrzBJDEA0v2RgjogxHCRp_large.jpg","description":"Louis Malle meets Lewis Carroll in this bizarre and bewitching trip down the rabbit hole. After skirting the horrors of a mysterious war being waged in the countryside, beautiful young Lily (Cathryn Harrison) takes refuge in a remote farmhouse, where she becomes embroiled in the surreal domestic life of an extremely unconventional family. Evocatively shot by cinematographer Sven Nykvist, Black Moon is a Freudian tale of adolescent sexuality set in a postapocalyptic world of shifting identities and talking animals. It is one of Malle’s most experimental films and a cinematic daydream like no other.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Louis Malle","slug":"louis-malle"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Cathryn Harrison","role":"Lily","slug":"cathryn-harrison"},{"actor":"Thérèse Ghiese","role":"The old lady","slug":"therese-ghiese"},{"actor":"Alexandra Stewart","role":"The sister","slug":"alexandra-stewart"},{"actor":"Joe Dallesandro","role":"The brother","slug":"joe-dallesandro"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Louis Malle","slug":"louis-malle"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Nouvelles Éditions de Films","slug":null},{"role":"Producer","person":"Bioskop Munich","slug":null},{"role":"Written by","person":"Louis Malle","slug":"louis-malle"},{"role":"Additional dialogue by","person":"Joyce Buñuel","slug":null},{"role":"Production manager","person":"Paul Maigret","slug":null},{"role":"Director of photography","person":"Sven Nykvist","slug":"sven-nykvist"},{"role":"Editing","person":"Suzanne Baron","slug":null},{"role":"Production design","person":"Roland Thenot","slug":null},{"role":"Art direction","person":"Ghislain Uhry","slug":null},{"role":"Assistant di